{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The movable object is a carrier: a peg can jump onto it, travel along the tracks, then jump off. A clone completed level 2 by loading the upper board’s last peg and ferrying it to capture the isolated lower peg. I’ll extend the existing jump planner for staged goals and add a small carrier-routing leg."}}
